    "detailed_description": "<i>Augmented Brutality is a lightning fast, hyperviolent top-down shooter in a nightmarish techno-industrial setting. Shoot, dismember, head-stomp and door-kick your way through dozens of handcrafted levels using any edge you can find to tilt the impossible odds to your favor. It's time to get bloody.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/87f9e31a1d875229dfffb7da0bcb5797.avif?t=1718164471\" width=616 height=220 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/ee5bb2f5b757ae630d52d3395c95621f.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/ee5bb2f5b757ae630d52d3395c95621f.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/ee5bb2f5b757ae630d52d3395c95621f.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to OmegaTech Tower, an industry-leading weapons technology facility, and the birthplace of humanity's extinction. Due to your own horrific actions (intentional or not) you find yourself caught between a malevolent A.I. and the thousand-strong Omega Task Force with only one option... Kill everyone who isn't you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/5795f38bb1e5b93ec06973afb0502b22.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/5795f38bb1e5b93ec06973afb0502b22.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/5795f38bb1e5b93ec06973afb0502b22.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>Inspired by the high-octane, &quot;blink and you're dead&quot; excess of games like Hotline Miami and Nuclear Throne, Augmented Brutality aims to distill the thrilling sneak/kill gameplay loop and almost puzzle-like trial and error of the former with the inventive gunplay and blood pumping action of the latter. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/7f96ed78b81bc1095b0db2d80061434c.avif?t=1718164471\" width=493 height=124 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Utilize discarded technology to dispatch your foes in increasingly gruesome ways, from rocket-propelled knives to the bullet-bending Angler and much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/783993171f00d4af6c8e78115d17463c.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/783993171f00d4af6c8e78115d17463c.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/783993171f00d4af6c8e78115d17463c.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Build up your Adrenaline meter by chaining kills together and access your newly augmented abilities to keep the chain going.<br><br><br></li><li>Learn the hidden mechanics of the scoring system and replay cleared areas to rise higher on the leaderboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/68032b0eb9a9ba14d6db64022d56192f.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/68032b0eb9a9ba14d6db64022d56192f.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/68032b0eb9a9ba14d6db64022d56192f.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Play the way you want to. Stealthily pick off one enemy at a time, punching and stomping your way to victory, or rip a turret off the wall and cause a commotion, bringing the fight to you. Pick off patrolling guards on the other side of the level with weapons like the wall-piercing Railgun and the wall-ignoring Slasher, or fill a bathroom with explosive barrels and lure them to their gory end. Nothing is off the table. Besides mercy, of course.<br><br><br></li><li>Dozens of hand-crafted levels split into unlockable chapters. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/3549a4b34bf48856646418204134dace.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/3549a4b34bf48856646418204134dace.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/3549a4b34bf48856646418204134dace.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Boss fights against robotic abominations and far, far worse. Encounters that <i>enhance<i></i></i> the flow of play, rather than halting it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/b76663fe35bd42a130df54232bee752e.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/b76663fe35bd42a130df54232bee752e.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/b76663fe35bd42a130df54232bee752e.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Die, learn from you mistakes, respawn and die again, repeating the process until you execute the level with perfection. Or throw caution to the wind and skull-stomp your way to the elevator. Just make sure to wipe the brains off your shoes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/c59ec53055bc1b40ac672b88bc62ce9c.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/c59ec53055bc1b40ac672b88bc62ce9c.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/c59ec53055bc1b40ac672b88bc62ce9c.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>A Techno-horror story with deep lore and full of twists and turns with themes of body horror, transhumanism, digitized consciousness and more.<br><br></li><li>An awesome, pulse pounding darksynth soundtrack.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Augmented Brutality is a lightning fast, hyperviolent top-down shooter in a nightmarish techno-industrial setting. Shoot, dismember, head-stomp and door-kick your way through dozens of handcrafted levels using any edge you can find to tilt the impossible odds to your favor. It's time to get bloody.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/87f9e31a1d875229dfffb7da0bcb5797.avif?t=1718164471\" width=616 height=220 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/ee5bb2f5b757ae630d52d3395c95621f.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/ee5bb2f5b757ae630d52d3395c95621f.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/ee5bb2f5b757ae630d52d3395c95621f.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to OmegaTech Tower, an industry-leading weapons technology facility, and the birthplace of humanity's extinction. Due to your own horrific actions (intentional or not) you find yourself caught between a malevolent A.I. and the thousand-strong Omega Task Force with only one option... Kill everyone who isn't you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/5795f38bb1e5b93ec06973afb0502b22.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/5795f38bb1e5b93ec06973afb0502b22.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/5795f38bb1e5b93ec06973afb0502b22.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>Inspired by the high-octane, &quot;blink and you're dead&quot; excess of games like Hotline Miami and Nuclear Throne, Augmented Brutality aims to distill the thrilling sneak/kill gameplay loop and almost puzzle-like trial and error of the former with the inventive gunplay and blood pumping action of the latter. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/7f96ed78b81bc1095b0db2d80061434c.avif?t=1718164471\" width=493 height=124 /></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Utilize discarded technology to dispatch your foes in increasingly gruesome ways, from rocket-propelled knives to the bullet-bending Angler and much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/783993171f00d4af6c8e78115d17463c.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/783993171f00d4af6c8e78115d17463c.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/783993171f00d4af6c8e78115d17463c.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Build up your Adrenaline meter by chaining kills together and access your newly augmented abilities to keep the chain going.<br><br><br></li><li>Learn the hidden mechanics of the scoring system and replay cleared areas to rise higher on the leaderboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/68032b0eb9a9ba14d6db64022d56192f.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/68032b0eb9a9ba14d6db64022d56192f.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/68032b0eb9a9ba14d6db64022d56192f.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Play the way you want to. Stealthily pick off one enemy at a time, punching and stomping your way to victory, or rip a turret off the wall and cause a commotion, bringing the fight to you. Pick off patrolling guards on the other side of the level with weapons like the wall-piercing Railgun and the wall-ignoring Slasher, or fill a bathroom with explosive barrels and lure them to their gory end. Nothing is off the table. Besides mercy, of course.<br><br><br></li><li>Dozens of hand-crafted levels split into unlockable chapters. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/3549a4b34bf48856646418204134dace.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/3549a4b34bf48856646418204134dace.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/3549a4b34bf48856646418204134dace.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Boss fights against robotic abominations and far, far worse. Encounters that <i>enhance<i></i></i> the flow of play, rather than halting it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/b76663fe35bd42a130df54232bee752e.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/b76663fe35bd42a130df54232bee752e.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/b76663fe35bd42a130df54232bee752e.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Die, learn from you mistakes, respawn and die again, repeating the process until you execute the level with perfection. Or throw caution to the wind and skull-stomp your way to the elevator. Just make sure to wipe the brains off your shoes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/c59ec53055bc1b40ac672b88bc62ce9c.poster.avif?t=1718164471\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/c59ec53055bc1b40ac672b88bc62ce9c.webm?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606340/extras/c59ec53055bc1b40ac672b88bc62ce9c.mp4?t=1718164471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>A Techno-horror story with deep lore and full of twists and turns with themes of body horror, transhumanism, digitized consciousness and more.<br><br></li><li>An awesome, pulse pounding darksynth soundtrack.</li></ul>",
